  ><title id="title-small-right-938517105">
      Berenberg Fund Overview
    </title><use xlink:href="#small-right"></use></svg><span class="text text--copy-link " >Berenberg Fund Overview</span></a></div></div></div><div class="standard__max-width"><main class="standard__main"><div class="blocks" ><section class="blocks__block" data-type="text" ><div class="richtext richtext--has-grid " ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><h2>Consistently active</h2><p><strong>Berenberg offers equity funds with compelling track records and top ratings. A specialised team of experienced portfolio managers is dedicated to making long-term, carefully considered investments in companies on the basis of in-depth analysis and ongoing discussions with senior company management.</strong></p><p>At the heart of this focused approach are high-quality companies of all sizes: high and rising returns on capital, strong free cash flow and attractive earnings growth – across all sectors.</p></div></div></section><section class="blocks__block" data-type="list" ><div class="list list--has-background "><h2 class="text text--headline-2 list__headline" >
    Our approach to equity fund management
  </h2><div class="list__content"><ul class="list__ul"><li class="list__item"><svg class="svg-sprite list__check-icon svg-sprite--filled-list"
  
  
  
  
  
  data-js-module="svg-sprite"
  aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; ><use xlink:href="#filled-list"></use></svg><div class="list__item-text"><h3 class="text text--subhead-1 list__item-headline" >
    Berenberg’s equities competence
  </h3><div class="richtext richtext--is-large list__item-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><ul><li>Outstanding expertise on companies in every market capitalisation segment</li><li>Proven investment approach: quality and growth</li><li>Concentrated portfolios</li></ul></div></div></div></li><li class="list__item"><svg class="svg-sprite list__check-icon svg-sprite--filled-list"
  
  
  
  
  
  data-js-module="svg-sprite"
  aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; ><use xlink:href="#filled-list"></use></svg><div class="list__item-text"><h3 class="text text--subhead-1 list__item-headline" >
    Strict philosophy
  </h3><div class="richtext richtext--is-large list__item-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><ul><li>Active management independent of benchmarks</li><li>Long-term in orientation – flexible through the cycle</li><li>Governance as an integral part of our quality assessment</li></ul></div></div></div></li><li class="list__item"><svg class="svg-sprite list__check-icon svg-sprite--filled-list"
  
  
  
  
  
  data-js-module="svg-sprite"
  aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; ><use xlink:href="#filled-list"></use></svg><div class="list__item-text"><h3 class="text text--subhead-1 list__item-headline" >
    Investment focus
  </h3><div class="richtext richtext--is-large list__item-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><ul><li>Quality businesses that stand out for their organic growth, robust balance sheets, above-average profitability and strong competitive position</li><li>Long-term, company-specific growth drivers</li></ul></div></div></div></li></ul><div class="list__cta"><a class="button button--primary button-- "
    href="https://www.berenberg.de/en/funds/"
    title="Fund overview"
    target="_blank"
    ><span class="text text--copy-link " >Fund overview</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="blocks__block" data-type="teaserRow" ><div
	class="teaser-row teaser-row--align-centered " ><div
		class="teaser-row__teasers"><a href="https://www.berenberg.de/en/funds/equities/management-team/" title="Equity Fund Management" target="_self" class="teaser-row__teaser teaser-row__teaser--has-background" ><div class="teaser-row__teaser-content"><div class="teaser-row__teaser-image-wrapper"><div class="image" style="--ratio: 1.3301369863014"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_ab006c74239a1023746effe69c0fb288.avif 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_432530861b8a2ffce6771b03b288be73.avif 640w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_1632f460c9788d7da304914aa5212771.avif 900w" width="550" height="413" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 325px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 60vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_ab006c74239a1023746effe69c0fb288.webp 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_432530861b8a2ffce6771b03b288be73.webp 640w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_1632f460c9788d7da304914aa5212771.webp 900w" width="550" height="413" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 325px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 60vw"><img src="/uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_ab006c74239a1023746effe69c0fb288.png" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_ab006c74239a1023746effe69c0fb288.png 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_432530861b8a2ffce6771b03b288be73.png 640w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Landingpages/1876905/iStock-892807312_4-3_1632f460c9788d7da304914aa5212771.png 900w" width="550" height="413" alt="" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 325px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 60vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position: 50% 50%;"></picture></div></div><p class="text text--headline-3 teaser-row__teaser-headline" >
    Equity Fund Management
  </p><div class="richtext teaser-row__teaser-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><p>We are active stock pickers. Based on our own analysis, we invest in quality companies with high returns on capital, strong cash flows and attractive earnings growth.</p></div></div></div><p class="text teaser-row__teaser-read-more" >
    Read more
  </p></a><a href="https://www.berenberg.de/en/funds/equities/investment-philosophy/" title="Our investment philosophy" target="_self" class="teaser-row__teaser teaser-row__teaser--has-background" ><div class="teaser-row__teaser-content"><div class="teaser-row__teaser-image-wrapper"><div class="image" style="--ratio: 1.3295210864904"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_94333109d599e99300ffc8a7d0523b22.avif 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_432530861b8a2ffce6771b03b288be73.avif 640w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_1632f460c9788d7da304914aa5212771.avif 900w" width="550" height="414" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 325px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 60vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_94333109d599e99300ffc8a7d0523b22.webp 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_432530861b8a2ffce6771b03b288be73.webp 640w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_1632f460c9788d7da304914aa5212771.webp 900w" width="550" height="414" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 325px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 60vw"><img src="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_94333109d599e99300ffc8a7d0523b22.png" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_94333109d599e99300ffc8a7d0523b22.png 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_432530861b8a2ffce6771b03b288be73.png 640w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1982777/iStock-504918804_1632f460c9788d7da304914aa5212771.png 900w" width="550" height="414" alt="" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 325px, (min-width: 1024px) 25vw, 60vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position: 50% 50%;"></picture></div></div><p class="text text--headline-3 teaser-row__teaser-headline" >
    Our investment philosophy
  </p><div class="richtext teaser-row__teaser-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper">
            We would like to provide you with a deeper insight into our philosophy and our way of thinking. Our aim is for you to understand the principles behind our approach, and enable you to decide on this basis whether you would like to accompany us on our chosen route.
  </div></div></div><p class="text teaser-row__teaser-read-more" >
    Read more
  </p></a></div></div></section><section class="blocks__block" data-type="text" ><div class="richtext richtext--has-grid " ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><h2>Our strategic focus areas</h2><p>Our focused product range offers you the right investment solution and several ways to implement it: in addition to our mutual funds, we offer our strategies as professional asset management mandates or as customised funds for institutional investors.</p></div></div></section><section class="blocks__block" data-type="teaserRow" ><div
	class="teaser-row teaser-row--align-centered " ><div
		class="teaser-row__teasers"><div    class="teaser-row__teaser teaser-row__teaser--has-background" ><div class="teaser-row__teaser-content"><h3 class="text text--headline-3 teaser-row__teaser-headline" >
    Small Cap Equities
  </h3><div class="richtext teaser-row__teaser-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper">
            There are many companies to choose from in the small-cap segment. At the same time smaller companies receive significantly less attention from external analysts. However, this segment contains many little-known global market leaders with above-average growth rates.
  </div></div></div></div><div    class="teaser-row__teaser teaser-row__teaser--has-background" ><div class="teaser-row__teaser-content"><h3 class="text text--headline-3 teaser-row__teaser-headline" >
    Global Equities
  </h3><div class="richtext teaser-row__teaser-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper">
            Global leaders that dominate their markets are successful across the world and offer sustainable, above-average growth thanks to permanent innovation and stable business models. Furthermore, the small and mid cap segment offer interesting opportunities.
  </div></div></div></div><div    class="teaser-row__teaser teaser-row__teaser--has-background" ><div class="teaser-row__teaser-content"><h3 class="text text--headline-3 teaser-row__teaser-headline" >
    Emerging Asia Equities
  </h3><div class="richtext teaser-row__teaser-copy" ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><p>Asia is a dynamic region that is expected to continue experiencing strong growth in the years ahead. One reason is the profound transformation its economies have undergone over recent decades. While they were once primarily low-cost manufacturing hubs, they have since evolved into major end markets for consumer goods, advanced technology, and services.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="blocks__block" data-type="contacts" ><div class="contact contact--has-grid "
  
  data-js-module="contact"><h2 class="contact__headline contact__headline--align-center"><span class="text text--headline-2 " >Your contact</span></h2><div class="contact__wrapper"><div class="contact__contact"><div class="contact__image "></div><div class="contact__info"><button type="button"
              class="contact__vita-btn"
              title="Vita"
              aria-label="Vita"
              data-modal-id="2005962823-contact-vita"
              data-js-element="contact__vita-btn"><svg class="svg-sprite button__icon svg-sprite--big-vita"
  aria-hidden="true"
  
  
  
  
  data-js-module="svg-sprite"
  ><use xlink:href="#big-vita"></use></svg></button><div class="modal modal--has-grid  theme--orange"
  
  role="dialog"
  id="2005962823-contact-vita"
  aria-labelledby="2005962823-contact-vita-label"
  aria-modal="true"
  hidden
  data-js-module="modal"
  data-modal-locked="false"><div class="modal__wrapper"><div class="modal__content" data-js-element="modal__content"><button class="button button--icon button--icon-only modal__close"
    
    
    title="Close"
    aria-label="Close"
    data-js-element="modal__close" ><svg class="svg-sprite button__icon svg-sprite--big-close"
  
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="title-big-close-402581629"
  
  
  data-js-module="svg-sprite"
  ><title id="title-big-close-402581629">
      Close
    </title><use xlink:href="#big-close"></use></svg></button><div class="modal__body" data-js-element="modal__body"><div class="richtext modal__richtext" ><div class="richtext__wrapper"><p><strong>Isabell Silverio</strong></p><p><p>Isabell Silverio heads the Public Markets Product Specialists team at Berenberg. In this role, she serves as the primary point of contact for product- and client-specific enquiries across all Multi Asset, Fixed Income, Liquid Alternatives and Equities strategies. She also supports the continuous development and enhancement of Berenberg's product platform.</p><p>After completing her Bachelor's degree in Business Administration, she gained experience in Investment Banking, specialising in Mergers &amp; Acquisitions and Private Equity, before graduating with distinction from the Frankfurt School of Finance &amp; Management with a Master of Finance. Isabell Silverio is a CFA Charterholder and joined Berenberg in October 2020 as part of the Wealth &amp; Asset Management Graduate Programme in London.</p></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contact__upper"><div class="contact__title contact__title--has-vita"><span class="text text--copy-1 text--bold " >Isabell Silverio</span></div><div class="text text--copy-1 " >
    Head of Product Specialists Public Markets
  </div></div><a class="link link--primary contact__phone"  href="tel:+49 69 91 30 90-598" target="_self"><span class="text text--copy-link " >Phone +49 69 91 30 90-598</span></a><div class="contact__email"><a class="link link--primary email-link" data-email="isabell.silverio%40berenberg.com" data-js-element="mailto__email-link"  href="#" target="_self"><span class="text text--copy-link " >Contact us</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="blocks__block" data-type="teaserNews" ><div id="teaser-news"
  class="teaser-news "
  ><div class="teaser-news__content
        "><div class="teaser-news__overline"><span class="text text--overline " >Our publications</span></div><h2 class="text text--headline-2 teaser-news__headline" >
    Benefit from the experience, knowledge and excellent analyses delivered by our specialists
  </h2><a class="link link--primary teaser-news__link"  href="https://www.berenberg.de/en/news/aktien/" target="_self"><span class="text text--copy-link " >All publications</span></a></div><a href="https://www.berenberg.de/en/news/aktien/european-micro-caps/"
  title="European Micro Caps"
  target="_self"
  class="teaser teaser-news__teaser-blog has-hoverable-children"
  ><div class="teaser__image-wrapper"><div class="image" style="--ratio: 1"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_a1b20a141065a729e362c39db89a8f4c.avif 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_642aae02fa1a1ab86dc7d4111aae8be7.avif 600w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_f9d35c2e75cded6d5435415681c0a155.avif 1200w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_71876a5f6b93ab3ccb91a38099026e98.avif 1440w" width="550" height="550" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 550px, (min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 90vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_a1b20a141065a729e362c39db89a8f4c.webp 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_642aae02fa1a1ab86dc7d4111aae8be7.webp 600w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_f9d35c2e75cded6d5435415681c0a155.webp 1200w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_71876a5f6b93ab3ccb91a38099026e98.webp 1440w" width="550" height="550" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 550px, (min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 90vw"><img src="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_a1b20a141065a729e362c39db89a8f4c.png" srcset="/uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_a1b20a141065a729e362c39db89a8f4c.png 550w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_642aae02fa1a1ab86dc7d4111aae8be7.png 600w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_f9d35c2e75cded6d5435415681c0a155.png 1200w, /uploads/images/imager/web/Asset-Management/Images-Objects/1855819/iStock-2174150546_71876a5f6b93ab3ccb