    Spotlight offers insights into the Berenberg product universe and highlights key topics related to current market developments.
  </p></a><a href="https://www.berenberg.de/en/news/aktien/german-bazooka---renaissance-of-the-german-mittelstand/"
  title="„German Bazooka&quot; - Renaissance of the German Mittelstand?"
  target="_self"
